<h1 class="visually-hidden">About {{ site.name }}</h1>
<div class="about-body">
  {% homePhoto site.photoAlt %}
  <div class="about-bio">
    <p>Hey, I'm Ben. I'm studying computer engineering at UMD.</p>
    <p>These days I'm building software that helps underrepresented students in STEM build fulfilling lives and careers, and looking for my next role. I'm also going deeper on AI safety, ML systems, and networking, partly by turning a Raspberry Pi and an old gaming PC into a home lab.</p>
    <p>I know technology can improve people's lives. I want to keep doing that, and spend my time on fun, high-impact problems.</p>
    <p>Outside of work I meditate, run, and snowboard. I think a lot about perception, ego, and how technology changes the way we see the world.</p>
    <p>I write <a href="{{ site.substack }}">here</a>.</p>
    <p><a href="/about/more/">More about me</a>.</p>
